        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Baibal Lat piu o, khou hei bam tip bam o,",
            "’Thukmei, ’thanmei, latdyn e, ntaamv rio;",
            "Zip bammei bumaengc ta hei @<4 ’chyang thau e,",
            "Theihmei tiiringhmei nzihmei Lat re.",
            "",
            "Baibal Lat piu o! Baibal Lat piu o!",
            "Baibal zayloumei, aniu maibungc e!",
            "",
            "2 Baibal Lat piu o, mi hei lanvdaih kiu e;",
            "Guloumei lev ringcsuangmei tiilou e;",
            "Karamthukh saa ngachap khang baihmei maek ge;",
            "Phu o, Kasuaihiam kaganv nai bam khou!",
            "",
            "3 Chaeng maanvmei nunc khang zayloumei maibungc e,",
            "Bow nimei chabwan khang zayloumei e;",
            "’Maan kan nimei paapc mei khang machunhmei e;",
            "Gaandaih nunc khang builwang e, Baibal hei."
          ]
        }
      },
